      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCKY LINKS (1) was fresh up last time at this track where he finished seventh (18.90) in a Grade 3/4. Sure to be fitter. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. MONEY PIT (2) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 4th and beaten 8 lengths at this track (23.14). Form from his last run is proving strong. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. GRAVEL DUST (7) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 18.35 beating Classic Lass. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Bold showing expected again. MARK TO MARKET (4) is one of the chances after collecting a minor prize last time.",
